WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
- I have to talk about Housewives.

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.360
So I heard that you and Erica
had like a little thing,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.870
but y'all are good now?

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.230
- Well, you know she was upset...

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.320
- Okay when you start with "well."

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.727
- I know, exactly.

00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:10.086
No, we actually are good.

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:11.210
We are good right now.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.210
There were things in the show
that she saw over the season,

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.170
obviously, that hurt
her feelings, you know?

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.700
And, you know, we had a lot of questions.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.850
It was very confusing.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.010
And then there was a scene where

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.730
my husband and PK were like,

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.040
kind of like laughing and then, PK,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.560
they make me laugh and it's hard.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.393
It's like, when you're,

00:00:25.393 --> 00:00:26.226
when you're in church or something,

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:27.059
you're not supposed to
laugh and then you know,

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:28.200
you can't help it.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.890
- Yeah, I laugh in inappropriate
times all the time.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.240
- Right, and so that was kind of a thing.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.270
And I knew, oh gosh,

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.770
when she sees this,
she's going to be upset.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:35.440
And so, but we, you know,

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.720
we work through things on the reunion.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.730
- That's hard, like with, yeah,

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:40.960
friendships in general are hard...

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.320
- You think filming
Halloween was hard and scary?

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.920
Deal with these women for a bit.

